            "review_title": "Review at Chevap Saigon",
            "review_text": "Globepouncing\nÜberlingen, Germany396 contributions\n1\nTrue Balkan Comfort\nMay 2022\nChevap is one of our two favorite restaurants in Ho Chi Minh City. Obviously, the chevap platter (we always went for the 10-piece) is a winner, and we always had the gravče (beans) and an extra lepinja bread to go with it.\n\nThe owner is a great guy. Whenever we stopped in and he was there, he would pour us shots of rakia on the house. Everyone else there is great, too, and we always enjoyed visiting, but we also did takeout and delivery once in a while.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 11, 2022",
